Thumbs.db
# Fork: the prebuilt resvg static library must be committed despite the x64/
# and *.lib rules above so the project builds without a Rust toolchain.
# Both the directory and the file need re-including (last match wins).
!third_party/resvg/x64/
!third_party/resvg/x64/resvg.lib
